{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"errar":{"host":"30e1d850","siblings":["ee534b9a"]}},"rows":{"ee534b9a":{"word":"errar","rank":9866,"meanings":[{"headword":"errar","pos":"verb","source_reference":"kaikki:en-errar-pt-verb-Katk5bGw","translation":"to err (make a mistake)"},{"headword":"errar","pos":"verb","source_reference":"kaikki:en-errar-pt-verb-~-Nyy30b","translation":"to miss (fail to hit)"}]}},"examples":{"ee534b9a":{"m":[[{"t":"Vamos lá, preste atenção, para não me deixar errar.","e":"Come on, be attentive, so you don’t let me go wrong.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.912381,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"ed1fa1c9ed0f199a1d720595845dd80f","i":"1b2d66cb49ce62a8882077a09a39e8a2","r":"7345006:7342837","c":"carlosalberto","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7345006","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7345006","b":"Tatoeba sentence #7345006 by carlosalberto; English translation #7342837 by jimkillock","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7345006","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não tenha medo de errar quando estiver falando inglês.","e":"Don't be afraid to make mistakes when speaking English.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.897968,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"e79c0eca7914d13c62557ed7a5a7b41a","i":"26ff831cc990f8be76bfd1a9cccaee1e","r":"748826:26175","c":"brauliobezerra","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/748826","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/748826","b":"Tatoeba sentence #748826 by brauliobezerra; English translation #26175 by megamanenm","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/748826","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Mas lembre que se errar, vai perder 40 pontos do total.","e":"But, remember, if he fails, he'll have 40 points subtracted from his score.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.837484,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"dc2e138cf2be5b15c1c209ca7febd387","i":"339ae7fa5979bbd7b3ec8dfba806ac70","r":"6504280:7006806:728:5152109","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6504280","7006806","728"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Quem tem medo de errar tem menor capacidade de aprender.","e":"Those who are afraid of making mistakes have less ability to learn.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.877828,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"94131efbfb95062c9fff1fccc7795b8d","i":"4e4db7aed2495d1177524778a60da229","r":"6178896:6178928","c":"carlosalberto","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6178896","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6178896","b":"Tatoeba sentence #6178896 by carlosalberto; English translation #6178928 by carlosalberto","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6178896","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Tens de estar disposto a errar e sofrer algumas vezes.","e":"You have to be willing to fall, like, flat on your face sometimes, you know.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.583491,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"ffe4dca2919683d64c51da0cd9658961","i":"6933c72366eb655936d6d1adfacfbf5c","r":"4156972:7055100:1384:2588939","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4156972","7055100","1384"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Precisa de alguém que não tenha receio de errar, pelas razões certas.","e":"You need someone who isn't afraid of the wrong thing... for the right reasons.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.864353,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"ff45646ae44f15e94e2bb45d54ca78ca","i":"74f2287486d30b69429561f216305ce1","r":"3658772:6549845:526:2476344","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3658772","6549845","526"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Eu não deveria falar quando achar que está a errar?","e":"I shouldn't speak up when I think you're making a misstep?","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.843565,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"2f017c8c52b53bd1ba9b6612463c0b9a","i":"8052e73f73702c66aa9cb8fe5ae40c62","r":"6190642:6907398:580:4952670","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6190642","6907398","580"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não tens o direito de errar nem sequer uma vez.","e":"A single mistake, and you are a failure.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.47021,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"6327479e56e56464354c72271d1c1a8f","i":"9d9f50618ad9b1acaec08104c2182ce4","r":"12338903:27853","c":"carlosalberto","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12338903","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12338903","b":"Tatoeba sentence #12338903 by carlosalberto; English translation #27853 by AlanF_US","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12338903","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"E quando escolhemos temos sempre medo de errar.","e":"And when you choose, there's always the fear that you'll make a mistake.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.815048,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"4e1eceaa085feaa5ced1a4a0917a52c2","i":"c37e58968f06891b3e2edf41db9965fa","r":"5870528:7071768:12:4736179","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5870528","7071768","12"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Errar é humano. Culpar alguém pelos seus erros é ainda mais humano.","e":"To err is human. To blame someone else for your mistakes is even more human.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.894038,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"85df4851a9e29c147fe2b1b8fd4be535","i":"9e70483bc469f1d03fba84b5b941d831","r":"1825460:823015","c":"gleydin","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1825460","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1825460","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1825460 by gleydin; English translation #823015 by Scott","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1825460","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]}],[{"t":"Dispara tantas balas, que não há como errar.","e":"It shoots so many rounds, even you can't miss.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sente